        IF NOT affidavit's `o 34 r 13(a) it exhibits a copy of the arbitration agreement or any record of the content of the arbitration agreement` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (a) is a bare "must be supported by an affidavit ... exhibiting"; the text does not say what follows (O 3 r 2(4), outside this range, lists what the Court may do)
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 34 r 13(a) it exhibits the original order or direction made by the arbitral tribunal sought to be enforced` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (a) is a bare "must"; the text does not say what follows
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 34 r 13(b) it states the provisions of the Act or the applicable rules adopted in the arbitration on which the applicant relies` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (b) is a bare "must"; the text does not say what follows
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

