    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the parenthesis names that person "the debtor" and says nothing about anyone else

DECLARE `o 34 r 14(1) affidavit supporting the application for permission to enforce an award` HAS
    `o 34 r 14(1)(a) it exhibits the arbitration agreement or any record of the content of the arbitration agreement (the original or a copy)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 34 r 14(1)(a) it exhibits the original award or a copy of it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 34 r 14(1)(b) it states the name and the usual or last known place of residence or business of the creditor` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 34 r 14(1)(b) it states the name and the usual or last known place of residence or business of the debtor` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 34 r 14(1)(c) it states either that the award has not been complied with or the extent to which it has not been complied with at the date of the application` IS A BOOLEAN

