    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "An application under section 37 or 46 for permission to enforce an award"

-- src:5194 | 14. —(1) An application under section 37 or 46 for permission to enforce an award may be made without notice and must be supported by an affidavit — ( a )
