        IF NOT affidavit's `o 34 r 14(1)(a) it exhibits the original award or a copy of it` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (1)(a) is a bare "must"; the text does not say what follows
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 34 r 14(1)(b) it states the name and the usual or last known place of residence or business of the creditor` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (1)(b) is a bare "must"; the text does not say what follows
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 34 r 14(1)(b) it states the name and the usual or last known place of residence or business of the debtor` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (1)(b) is a bare "must"; the text does not say what follows
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 34 r 14(1)(c) it states either that the award has not been complied with or the extent to which it has not been complied with at the date of the application` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (1)(c) is a bare "must"; the text does not say what follows
