`o 34 r 7(6) the duty to file and serve the affidavit opposing permission` MEANS
    IF `the defendant wishes to contest the application for permission`
    THEN PARTY `o 34 r 5(3) the defendant`
         MUST `o 34 r 7(6) file and serve the affidavit opposing permission`
         WITHIN (`o 34 r 7(6) the period for the defendant's affidavit`'s `period length`)
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY `o 34 r 5(3) the defendant` BECAUSE "the affidavit was not filed and served within 28 days after service of the originating application and the affidavit in support"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- src:5143 | ( b )
-- src:5144 | within 28 days after the date of the granting of permission to appeal, the appellant must serve on the respondent — (i)
